    "detailed_description": "The game \u201cKing of The Jesters\u201d is a first-person adventure horror with puzzles.<br><br>After another episode, the lead singer of a punk rock band finds himself in a world of his fantasies.<br>Here, he meets all the characters from his songs and tries to understand their complicated fates. Decide their fate or guide them to the path of truth.<br>The choice is yours.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the world that inspired and guided the main character in his creativity.<br><strong>Music or something more?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/19fcb24fa34c235319347af80bde1bbc.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/19fcb24fa34c235319347af80bde1bbc.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>The Enchanted Forest Bewitches</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of madness and enjoy it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/948f41f5e1e5bf9c774f918db924eac9.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/948f41f5e1e5bf9c774f918db924eac9.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Someone is always behind you, watching you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/c25cd6b2c856ae764965113d8546ea22.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/c25cd6b2c856ae764965113d8546ea22.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Poly-antagonism</strong><br>The locations in the game reflect the external and internal appearance of each antagonist.<br>You are in for an exciting acquaintance with unique characters and their destinies.<br><br><strong>Alternative Plot Options</strong><br>Dive into the lives of the game\u2019s characters. Learn their stories and help solve their problems. Participate in various events and find ways to escape the predicaments you might find yourself in against your will.<br><br><strong>Rock, Rock, and More Rock</strong><br>Travel the world to unique punk rock music created by talented musicians inspired by our game.<br><br><strong>See Everything Hidden</strong><br>Use the cursed skull &quot;Gosha&quot; to see hidden objects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/aaccd99d2e3d3915c476fc0e01d35be0.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/aaccd99d2e3d3915c476fc0e01d35be0.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Stay Alert</strong><br>Animals and mystical forest dwellers can pose a threat to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/351d78deebdff9c28148fcc45eeee690.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/351d78deebdff9c28148fcc45eeee690.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A Vast Amount of Interactivity</strong><br>You can interact with the environment and explore it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/8a37e5a63a1f31ea422ffcf6a8db9e98.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/8a37e5a63a1f31ea422ffcf6a8db9e98.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>King of the Jesters is not just a game; it is a gaming masterpiece that will immerse you in a world of rock tales.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "The game \u201cKing of The Jesters\u201d is a first-person adventure horror with puzzles.<br><br>After another episode, the lead singer of a punk rock band finds himself in a world of his fantasies.<br>Here, he meets all the characters from his songs and tries to understand their complicated fates. Decide their fate or guide them to the path of truth.<br>The choice is yours.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the world that inspired and guided the main character in his creativity.<br><strong>Music or something more?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/19fcb24fa34c235319347af80bde1bbc.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/19fcb24fa34c235319347af80bde1bbc.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>The Enchanted Forest Bewitches</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of madness and enjoy it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/948f41f5e1e5bf9c774f918db924eac9.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/948f41f5e1e5bf9c774f918db924eac9.webm?t=1734570928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Someone is always behind you, watching you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833900/extras/c25cd6b2c856ae764965113d8546ea22.poster.avif?t=1734570928\" width=600 height=272 ><sou